-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
-- Backfill connector_types catalog.
-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
--
-- The original catalog was seeded via `prisma db push` in early dev
-- (2026-04-11), before formal migrations existed. Tenants that came
-- online via `prisma migrate` afterwards never received it — their
-- connector_types table holds only the rows added by later migrations
-- (notion, whatsapp_personal). The Connectors page is then empty
-- because there are no connector_types to enable.
--
-- This migration is idempotent (`ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING`) — it
-- only inserts rows that don't already exist. Tenants that already
-- have the full catalog see no change.
--
-- Pairs with 20260504_enable_default_personal_connectors which then
-- enables every active personal connector for every tenant.

ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;
